      badge: "High School (VGS)",
      heading1: "Top results and ",
      heading2: "effective learning in high school",
      intro: "Targeted guidance in challenging subjects. I provide the study strategies, practical methods, and test-taking tools required to master the curriculum and reduce anxiety.",
